# Wireframe: IssuesPage

## Purpose & Flow Context

Lists all issues for the team with filterable, scrollable IssueCards. Entry: app-shell "Issues" nav link or keyboard shortcut `G then I`. Exit: click card → IssueDetailPage, or "Create issue" → IssueFormModal.

---

## Version & Changelog

| Version | Type | Description |
|---------|------|-------------|
| 1.1.0 | MINOR | Added J/K keyboard card navigation (moved from deferred to implemented per spec); trimmed unused notation symbols |

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `👤` | User / mention |
| `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected | `[#]` | Badge |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys, J/K for card navigation |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm.

**App-shell**: Shared header + sidebar + content area. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Header | Logo, search trigger, notifications, avatar, theme toggle | Sticky top, z-50 |
| Sidebar | Team switcher, nav links (Issues, Projects, Cycles), user menu | Collapsible, fixed left |
| Main content | Page title + filters + issue list | Scrollable, fills remaining space |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Filter bar — primary navigation tool
2. Issue list — the main data display
3. Page title + action button

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Header: Logo] [Search] [Notifs] [Avatar] [Theme]               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  +-----------+  +------------------------------------------------+
|  | [Sidebar] |  |  [h1] Issues                   [New Issue][>]  |
|  |           |  |                                                  |
|  | [#Issues] |  |  [Status▼] [Assignee▼] [Project▼] [Clear]      |
|  | Projects  |  |                                                  |
|  | Cycles    |  |  +-- IssueCard ---------------------------------+
|  |           |  |  | ○ ENG-123  Fix login redirect               |
|  |           |  |  | [#Todo] [#Urgent]        [👤]                |
|  |           |  |  +----------------------------------------------+
|  |           |  |  +-- IssueCard ---------------------------------+
|  |           |  |  | ○ ENG-122  Add dark mode toggle            |
|  |           |  |  | [#In Progress] [#High]     [👤]              |
|  |           |  |  +----------------------------------------------+
|  |           |  |  +-- IssueCard ---------------------------------+
|  |           |  |  | ○ ENG-121  Update README                   |
|  |           |  |  | [#Done] [#Low]            [👤]               |
|  |           |  |  +----------------------------------------------+
|  |           |  |                                                  |
|  +-----------+  +------------------------------------------------+
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| "New Issue" button | Button (primary) | Opens IssueFormModal in create mode | — |
| Status filter | Select | Dropdown: Todo / In Progress / Done / All | All = null filter |
| Assignee filter | Select | Dropdown with user search | No match → "No users found" |
| Project filter | Select | Dropdown of projects | No projects → disabled |
| "Clear" button | Button (ghost) | Resets all filters to null | Hidden when no filters active |
| IssueCard | IssueCard | Click → navigate to detail | — |
| Checkbox `○` | — | Selection for bulk ops (future) | Placeholder, not active |
| Avatar in card | Avatar (sm) | Click → filter by assignee (future) | Placeholder |

## Data Display

List of cards — preferred over table for variable-height rows (titles wrap, metadata flex). Each card is a self-contained unit with ID, title, status badge, priority badge, assignee avatar. Consistent vertical rhythm, 8px internal card padding.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| `h1` "Issues" | Page title — user knows what module they're in | — |
| "New Issue" button | Primary CTA — create a new work item | Consistent label across views |
| "No issues yet" (empty) | First-run state — invites creation | See empty state below |
| Filter dropdown placeholders | "Status", "Assignee", "Project" | Label is the filter dimension |
| "Clear filters" | Action to remove all active filters | Only when filters active |

## States

### Populated (Default)

The layout shown above: sidebar + filter bar + scrollable list of IssueCards. Cards show identifier, title, status badge, priority indicator, assignee.

### Empty

Two sub-cases:

**First-run (no issues exist at all):**
```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                      [📋 Icon Illustration]                       |
|                      No issues yet                                |
|                      Create the first issue to get started.       |
|                      [ Create Issue ]                             |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

**Filtered to zero:**
```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                      [🔍 Icon Illustration]                       |
|                      No issues match your filters                 |
|                      Try adjusting or clearing your filters.      |
|                      [ Clear Filters ]                            |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [==== skeleton bar ====]                                        |
|  [==== skeleton bar ====]                                        |
|  +-- skeleton card ------------------------------+               |
|  | [======= skeleton line ======]               |               |
|  | [==== skeleton ====]          [=======]      |               |
|  +----------------------------------------------+               |
|  +-- skeleton card ------------------------------+               |
|  | [======= skeleton line ======]               |               |
|  | [==== skeleton ====]          [=======]      |               |
|  +----------------------------------------------+               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

3 skeleton card rows mirroring the card height and layout.

### Error

Inline banner below filter bar, not blocking (list still shows cached data if any). If no cache, replaces list.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [⚠] Could not load issues. [ Retry ]                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full sidebar + card list as shown |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Sidebar collapsed to icons; filters wrap to 2 rows |
| Mobile (<768px) | Sidebar → overlay hamburger; filters stack vertically; cards full-width |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `header` (app header), `nav` (sidebar), `main` (issue list) |
| Heading order | `h1` "Issues" → `h2` (section: filter bar) → card titles as `h3` |
| Reading / Focus order | Sidebar nav links → header controls → page title → filters → card list |
| Accessible names | Filter selects get `aria-label="Filter by {dimension}"`; "New Issue" button text is label |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through filters; Arrow keys move between select options; Enter selects; J/K to focus prev/next card; Enter on focused card opens detail |
| Target size | Filter triggers and cards ≥24×24 px |
| Focus not obscured | Cards scroll fully into view; sticky header doesn't overlap focused card |
| Non-color intent | Status uses icon + text badge; priority uses icon + color; never color alone |
